OL,3,GNEWSA'We are sad our play park will be
OL,4,Ashut for months'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city play area has closed for a major
OL,7,Frevamp, leaving families with young
OL,8,Fchildren disappointed.
OL,10,FThe play area at War Memorial Park has
OL,11,Fbecome outdated, Coventry City Council
OL,12,Fsaid, and it has received additional
OL,13,Ffunding to rebuild it, replace the
OL,14,Fwater feature and put a multi-use games
OL,15,Farea in its place.
OL,17,FBut visitors have told BBC CWR they
OL,18,Fonly found out about the closure when
OL,19,Fthey arrived with children to find it
OL,20,Ffenced off with a notice suggesting it
OL,21,Fwill re-open in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
